<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CompUSA raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CompUSA raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it upgraded CompUSA Inc to market outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Separately, CompUSA said Wednesday its fourth quarter same-store sales rose 9.7 percent.</p>
<p>-- CompUSA gained 1-11/16 to 22-15/16.</p>
